            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The coronary thrombosis is the main factor which leads to acute coronary syndrome. The mechanisms of the coronary thrombogenesis are not found out in detail. It was investigated the changes of the lipid acids spectrum of platelet membrane phospholipids in patients with unstable angina.</AbstractText>
